@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Get all tickets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets

### Get one ticket
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1

### Create a ticket
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Damaged item received",
  "customerEmail": "neha@example.com",
  "priority": 1
}

### Update a ticket
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Order not delivered",
  "customerEmail": "riya@example.com",
  "priority": 2,
  "status": "Resolved"
}

### Delete a ticket
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/2

### Validation error (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "customerEmail": "not-an-email",
  "priority": 9
}
